            "notes": "I've never played a Quickplay match that has made it to round 5, so I don't really know what's feasible to buy at this point. \n\nSell  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and buy these purples in the following order of priority (depending on what you can afford):\n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) (more cooldown reduction)\n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) (increases ult charge rate)\n- also if you have the cash, you can sell [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) and replace with an epic item that boosts your weapon power. I suggest [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) or  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)\n\nRead the notes on each power option for situational tips on which to choose.",
